WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.180
Over a thousand years ago, envoys of
Prince Vladimir of Kyiv attended worship

2
00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:07.010
in Constantinople.

3
00:00:07.060 --> 00:00:11.670
A chronicle says they did not know
whether they were in heaven or on earth.

4
00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:17.790
Yet in that same empire, the Iconoclasts had
tried to remove sacred images altogether.

5
00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:23.510
So can a painting, a song or a string
of beads bring someone closer to God?

6
00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:27.600
In this mission, you'll see why
Orthodox Christians kiss icons,

7
00:00:27.650 --> 00:00:30.930
while many Protestant churches
keep their walls plain.

8
00:00:30.980 --> 00:00:35.860
Then you'll explore music and prayer,
from Orthodox chant to praise bands and

9
00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:37.340
silent prayer.

10
00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:42.560
Your mission: weigh up whether art, music
and aids to prayer can bring believers

11
00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:43.730
closer to God.
